@startuml
title UC-04 Meal retrieval v1.2
|Staff|
start
:Identify using QR, barcode or NIM;
if (Network available?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Save pending identification locally;
  :Show unconfirmed status;
  :Reconnect and request synchronization;
endif
|Server|
:Authenticate and authorize;
:Resolve Asia/Makassar date and approved schedule;
if (Serving window open and pending date valid?) then (yes)
  :Check same-day pause and complete student profile;
  :Begin atomic retrieval validation;
  if (Duplicate or invalid?) then (yes)
    :Reject without meal record;
  else (no)
    :Save one retrieval with trusted staff identity;
    :Complete matching same-day queue entry;
    :Commit and return receipt token;
  endif
else (no)
  :Reject new retrieval;
  |Staff|
  :Keep pending identification unresolved for review;
endif
stop
@enduml
